Bundled fonts
-------------

All fonts are redistributed unmodified under the SIL Open Font Licence 1.1.

- `templates/web/static/fonts/space-grotesk/` holds Space Grotesk 2.0.0, redistributed unmodified from the SpaceGrotesk-2.0.0.zip release at https://github.com/floriankarsten/space-grotesk/releases/tag/2.0.0; its licence text is `OFL.txt` beside the font files.
- `templates/web/static/fonts/inter/` holds Inter 4.1, redistributed unmodified from the Inter-4.1.zip release at https://github.com/rsms/inter/releases/tag/v4.1; its licence text is `OFL.txt` beside the font files (the Google Fonts distribution of the same Inter OFL text, google/fonts commit b0928647ba26c8d55548aa19feb2f7aeba622d4a, ofl/inter/OFL.txt: the Inter release LICENSE.txt differs from the canonical OFL-1.1 only in its heading PERMISSION AND CONDITIONS (canonical: PERMISSION & CONDITIONS), which the gate hash rejects).
